Caveat: HP-MT is an idealised estimate (perfect bonding, no matrix porosity,
no particle breakage); measured syntactic-foam moduli typically fall 20-40 %
below it, so the design above should be treated as an upper-bound-of-optimism
target and verified experimentally. The optimum eta is also thinner-walled
than any standard 3M grade, so the practical choice is the best commercial
grade in the table above.
